1
00:00:00,400 --> 00:00:04,160
I always sat in the back seat growing
up.

2
00:00:07,400 --> 00:00:10,590
Watching my older siblings take the
wheel.

3
00:00:14,000 --> 00:00:18,040
Then came the day I sat in the driver's
seat.

4
00:00:21,000 --> 00:00:28,390
The first time Dad let me drive, I was
so nervous. The car kept stalling.

5
00:00:29,200 --> 00:00:31,420
Checking the mirror over and over.

6
00:00:35,800 --> 00:00:39,390
Now my phone lights up, day or night.

7
00:00:42,800 --> 00:00:45,040
I drive my sisters home at night.

8
00:00:49,400 --> 00:00:52,370
By day, I take my parents on their
errands.

9
00:00:56,000 --> 00:00:58,630
The little ones sit on my lap and hold
the wheel.

10
00:01:02,600 --> 00:01:05,020
The little kid from the back seat...

11
00:01:09,200 --> 00:01:11,720
...is the one who brings everyone home.
